#: alexa/data.py:6
msgid "Welcome to {}"
msgstr "Welkom bij {}"

#: alexa/data.py:7
msgid ""
"Welcome to {}. You can play, stop, resume listening.  How can I help you"
" ?"
msgstr ""
"Welkom bij {}. Je kunt afspelen, stoppen of hervatten.  Waarmee kan ik je "
"helpen?"

#: alexa/data.py:8
msgid "Sorry, I could not understand what you've just said."
msgstr "Sorry, ik heb niet begrepen wat je zei."

#: alexa/data.py:9
msgid "This is radio, you have to wait for previous or next track to play."
msgstr "Dit is radio, je moet wachten op het vorige of volgende nummer."

#: alexa/data.py:10
msgid "Resuming {}"
msgstr "{} hervatten"

#: alexa/data.py:11
msgid ""
"This is radio, you can not do that.  You can ask me to stop or pause to "
"stop listening."
msgstr ""
"Dit is radio, dat kan niet.  Je kunt me vragen te stoppen of te pauzeren "
"om te stoppen met luisteren."

#: alexa/data.py:12
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "Tot ziens!"

#: alexa/data.py:13
msgid "Sorry, this skill is not supported on this device"
msgstr "Sorry, deze skill wordt niet ondersteund op dit apparaat."

#: alexa/data.py:15
msgid "test english"
msgstr "test nederlands"

#: alexa/data.py:16
msgid "test with parameters {} and {}"
msgstr "test met parameters {} en {}"